      "section": null,
      "aliases": [
        "loc:EnableRowLevelSecurity",
        "dom:SecuritySettings_EnableRowLevelSecurity"
      ],
      "rules": "Yes or no.",
      "when": null,
      "html": "<p><strong>What it is.</strong> Whether row-level security is applied.</p><p><strong>Why it matters.</strong> Ticked, the places that apply row-level security limit users to the employees their security assignments allow, and scheduled report recipients are limited the same way. Unticked, no row-level restriction applies.</p>",
